1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,500
AeroRehab: early warning for astronaut knee deconditioning.

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:07,000
In microgravity, leg muscles lose 10 to 15 percent of their strength.

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:11,800
AeroRehab compares every session with the astronaut's own baseline.

4
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:17,000
Here's Commander Okafor's knee range of motion, Day 12 to Day 42.

5
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:21,000
By Day 38 it's back within 5% of baseline: All Good.

6
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:25,000
On Day 42 it drops 15 percent below baseline: Action Required.

7
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:28,000
Every alert explains why, and links to a rehab plan.

8
00:00:28,000 --> 00:00:30,000
AeroRehab. NASA Space Apps Challenge 2026.
